# Code owners.
#
# No GitHub teams exist for this project yet, so this file is currently a
# documentation aid rather than an enforcement mechanism: it records which
# module each path belongs to (see docs/MODULES.md) so a reviewer can tell at
# a glance whether a PR crosses a boundary it should not.
#
# To turn it into real review routing, replace the comments below with GitHub
# handles or @org/team names and enable "Require review from Code Owners" in
# branch protection.

